{%- comment -%}
  Reviewer quote. Placeholder copy until there is a real one.

  Split out of tonescan-landing so the page composes from real sections in a JSON
  template. Page-wide CSS and JS are rendered once by layout/tonescan.liquid, so this
  file carries markup only and can be reordered or removed without taking them with it.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="tonescan-landing tw:text-neutral-200">
  <section class="ts-quote-sec">
    <div class="ts-quote">

      <div class="ts-quote__body">
        <blockquote class="ts-quote__text">
          [ Short testimonial goes here. Two or three sentences at most. The best ones name the
          thing that changed: how long a roll used to take, what they stopped doing, what they can
          now hand a client. ]
        </blockquote>

        <div class="ts-quote__by">
          <span class="ts-quote__avatar" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="3.6"/><path d="M4.8 20a7.2 7.2 0 0 1 14.4 0"/></svg>
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="ts-quote__name">[ Reviewer name ]</p>
            <p class="ts-quote__org">[ Role ] · [ Organisation ]</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Right half: a photo supplied by the person quoted. Borderless and full height on
        purpose, replace .ts-quote__ph with <img class="ts-quote__img" src="..." alt="...">
        and it will fill the cell edge to edge.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="ts-quote__media">
        <div class="ts-quote__ph">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="1"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="10" r="1.6"/><path d="M4 17l5-5 3.5 3.5L16 12l4 4"/></svg>
          <span>[ Photo from the reviewer ]</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "toneScan testimonial",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "toneScan testimonial"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
